    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazon Animals is a jigsaw puzzle featuring animals from the Amazon rainforest. Embark on a journey to the largest forest in the world and get to know the fauna of this place in beautiful hand-drawn 2D artwork</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete levels and conquer leaves to unlock new animals for you to play, getting to know all the species at different levels of difficulty in this fun and minimalist game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382880/extras/2a88134c2867c545f9596b290efe7f30.avif?t=1754062076\" data-has-big width=800 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag pieces, see a preview, mix, assemble and have fun without time or competition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lo-fi Music</p></li></ul>",
